d enters due to inevitable reasons.\" Dressed up in the sexy suit, Akiwo faces up to Burusera Mask ... for someone in her heart and/or to save all the students...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cPBGWgh0JOph64Sgb10RL3Fr1vH.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"2831","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"668","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"668","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"44567","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"97091","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"39113","synopsis":"On a rainy day, Tetsuro goes out to meet Otome as he is told strictly not to let her get wet. Otome Konno, the brain of Koi Koi Seven, has a big secret. \"Are my hands warm?\" Tetsuro is surprised to check Otome's temperature. She invites him for a hang-around on the way back home and takes Tetsuro to a soggy puppy in a cardboard box. What does she intend to do for this dog?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sANY7QCmdy0pltjElyQPptW8F2Y.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"On a rainy day, Tetsuro goes out to meet Otome as he is told strictly not to let her get wet. Otome Konno, the brain of Koi Koi Seven, has a big secret. \"Are my hands warm?\" Tetsuro is surprised to check Otome's temperature. She invites him for a hang-around on the way back home and takes Tetsuro to a soggy puppy in a cardboard box. What does she intend to do for this dog?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sANY7QCmdy0pltjElyQPptW8F2Y.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"2831","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"66